MILL - The Game of Nine Men's Morris
TEKMILL - The Same Game on a Tektronix Terminal
Player actions:
  A1          Place a stone at A1
  A1-A4       Move a stone from A1 to A4
  SAVE name   Save the current and previous game state
s
              as name and nameP
  QUIT        Quit the game

Command line:
  MILL name   Resume the saved current game state
  MILL nameP  Resume the saved previous game state
  /A          Automatic play: computer against compute
r
  /D          Save a debug log in Prints/day/time